### Gradle ###
.gradle/
build/
**/build/
!src/**/build/
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties
# Auto-generated by Gradle's daemon JVM auto-detection; pinned values would force
# a specific JDK across all contributors. We rely on jvmToolchain(25) instead.
gradle/gradle-daemon-jvm.properties

