### iOS / Xcode ###
# NOTE: iosApp/iosApp.xcodeproj/ and iosApp/iosApp/Info.plist are INTENTIONALLY
# committed even though XcodeGen regenerates them from iosApp/project.yml.
# Rationale: contributors can open Xcode without installing XcodeGen first.
# project.yml stays the editable source of truth.
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
Pods/
DerivedData/

